{"id":"219433ea709d592f","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md","title":"模型扩张推出保守性","display":"thm-conservative-extension-axioms — 模型扩张推出保守性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms","aliases":["91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms"],"display":"thm-conservative-extension-axioms — 模型扩张推出保守性","depends_on":["[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","[[91-df-ground-language]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-conservative-extension-axioms — 模型扩张推出保守性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4a1d989a5f615933\" href=\"?note=4a1d989a5f615933\" title=\"91-df-conservative-truth\">91-df-conservative-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2ad7561edabb2148\" href=\"?note=2ad7561edabb2148\" title=\"91-df-ground-language\">91-df-ground-language</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> (基础语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span> 中的一阶理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\supseteq\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal S\\supseteq\\mathcal B\\)</span> (扩展语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> 中的理论)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpProp}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExpProp}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>-模型都有同底集的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span>-扩张)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)\">\\(\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0\">\\(\\mathcal L_0\\)</span>-保守扩张)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}extension\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal M\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal M\\models\\mathcal B\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal M^+\\,\n(\\mathcal M^+\\models\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\mathcal M^+\\!\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathcal M)\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}extension\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal M\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal M\\models\\mathcal B\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal M^+\\,\n(\\mathcal M^+\\models\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\mathcal M^+\\!\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathcal M)\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\\nvdash\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal B\\nvdash\\varphi\\)</span>，完备性给出\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models\\mathcal B+\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal M\\models\\mathcal B+\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>。按模型扩张前提取\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M^+\\models\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal M^+\\models\\mathcal S\\)</span>；由于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 属于旧语言，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M^+\\models\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal M^+\\models\\neg\\varphi\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal S\\nvdash\\varphi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>“类型化”或“含基础句 T-schema”本身不是充分条件：还可人为加入新的\n算术公理如 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span>。TB、UTB、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\)</span>\n的保守性需要各自的模型扩张、消去或证明论定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-conservative-truth","status":"resolved","id":"4a1d989a5f615933","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-conservative-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-ground-language","status":"resolved","id":"2ad7561edabb2148","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-ground-language]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\supseteq\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExpProp}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{\\mathcal L_0}(\\mathcal S,\\mathcal B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}conservative\\text{-}extension\\text{-}axioms}\\vdash\n\\left[\n\\mathcal B\\subseteq\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\forall\\mathcal M\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\mathcal M\\models\\mathcal B\n\\to\n\\exists\\mathcal M^+\\,\n(\\mathcal M^+\\models\\mathcal S\n\\land\n\\mathcal M^+\\!\\upharpoonright\\mathcal L_0=\\mathcal M)\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\n\\to\n\\mathrm{ConservTh}_{